    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "class_b_01_math_01",
      "hash64": "57E6FF15A01D88CB",
      "text": "Hallo! Freut mich, euch alle kennenzulernen.\\nIch bin Quendella, eure Mathematiklehrerin.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "class_b_01_math_02",
      "hash64": "57E70015A01D8A7E",
      "text": "Gleich zu Beginn habe ich direkt eine Frage an\\neuch alle. Mögt ihr Zahlen und Rechenaufgaben?[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "class_b_01_popup_01",
      "hash64": "1C7DF4F0B24454F1",
      "text": "Jaaa!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "class_b_01_popup_02",
      "hash64": "1C7DF1F0B2444FD8",
      "text": "Geht so.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "class_b_01_popup_03",
      "hash64": "1C7DF2F0B244518B",
      "text": "Ähm...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "class_b_01_math_03",
      "hash64": "57E70115A01D8C31",
      "text": "Haha! Danke für eure ehrlichen Antworten.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "class_b_01_math_04",
      "hash64": "57E70215A01D8DE4",
      "text": "Es scheint, als ob sich einige von euch für Zahlen\\nbegeistern können und andere eher weniger.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "class_b_01_math_05",
      "hash64": "57E70315A01D8F97",
      "text": "Aber egal, wie ihr zu Mathematik steht,\\nmein Unterricht wird hoffentlich allen\\r\\nvon euch Spaß machen![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 103,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "class_b_01_math_06",
      "hash64": "57E70415A01D914A",
      "text": "Ah, da fällt mir ein! Wie gut kennt ihr euch\\nmit den Wechselwirkungen zwischen den\\r\\nPokémon-Typen aus?[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 104,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "class_b_01_math_07",
      "hash64": "57E70515A01D92FD",
      "text": "Zum Beispiel ist Pflanze sehr effektiv gegen\\nWasser.\\c\\nUnd Wasser ist wiederum sehr effektiv gegen\\nFeuer, richtig?[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 115,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "class_b_01_math_08",
      "hash64": "57E6F615A01D7980",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]Du kennst dich doch bestimmt gut mit Pokémon\\naus, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]. Kannst du mir Folgendes\\r\\nbeantworten?[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BD06",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 54,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "class_b_01_math_09",
      "hash64": "57E6F715A01D7B33",
      "text": "Die Wasser-Attacke Aquaknarre ist sehr effektiv\\ngegen den Typ Feuer. Was geschieht mit dem\\r\\nSchaden, wenn sie ein Feuer-Pokémon trifft?[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 137,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "class_b_01_select_01",
      "hash64": "27E4F980E00456F1",
      "text": "Er wird halbiert.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "class_b_01_select_02",
      "hash64": "27E4F680E00451D8",
      "text": "Er ändert sich nicht.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "class_b_01_select_03",
      "hash64": "27E4F780E004538B",
      "text": "Er wird verdoppelt.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "class_b_01_math_answer_01",
      "hash64": "1723D885F3F4473C",
      "text": "Oje, da verwechselst du wohl etwas.\\c\\nVielleicht hat dich die Frage etwas überrumpelt...\\nKann jedem mal passieren![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 115,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "class_b_01_math_answer_02",
      "hash64": "1723DB85F3F44C55",
      "text": "Das stimmt so leider nicht. Vielleicht hat dich die\\nFrage etwas überrumpelt... Kann jedem mal\\r\\npassieren![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 107,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "class_b_01_math_answer_03",
      "hash64": "1723DA85F3F44AA2",
      "text": "Genau! Dachte ich mir doch, dass diese Frage ein\\nKlacks für dich sein würde, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "class_b_01_math_10",
      "hash64": "57EA8415A020A0A1",
      "text": "Attacken eines Typs, gegen den euer Gegner\\nschwach ist, sind sehr effektiv.\\c\\nDas heißt, der Schaden wird verdoppelt![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 118,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "class_b_01_math_11",
      "hash64": "57EA8315A0209EEE",
      "text": "Im Gegensatz dazu sind Attacken eines Typs,\\ngegen den euer Gegner stark ist, nicht sehr\\r\\neffektiv. Dadurch halbiert sich der Schaden.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 135,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "class_b_01_math_12",
      "hash64": "57EA8215A0209D3B",
      "text": "Hihi! Das klingt ja fast, als würde ich den\\nKampfkurs unterrichten.\\c\\nIch will mich natürlich nicht in Señora Amuras\\nUnterricht einmischen, aber das kleine Beispiel\\r\\nmit Pokémon-Kämpfen hatte sich angeboten.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 165,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 210,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "class_b_01_math_13",
      "hash64": "57EA8115A0209B88",
      "text": "So macht Mathe sogar denjenigen Spaß, denen\\ndas Fach sonst nicht liegt! Hab ich recht?[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "class_b_01_math_14",
      "hash64": "57EA8815A020A76D",
      "text": "Oh, ist das etwa die Schulglocke? Schade,\\nunsere Zeit scheint um zu sein...[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "class_b_01_math_15",
      "hash64": "57EA8715A020A5BA",
      "text": "Ich freue mich bereits auf unsere nächste Stunde![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
